<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 69,289 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 69,289 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 69,289 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Thursday, compared to 75,298 tonnes on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Thursday	 Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			21,034	   30,465</p>
<p>    Import cargo			48,255	   44,833</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, six ships sailed and five berthed. In the next 24 hours, seven ships were expected to sail and 11 were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
